WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.260
- Hey good humans.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.180
We made a movie.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.700
When I first stumbled across
these viral admissions videos

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.770
to Ivy league schools, I
knew there was a story here

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:11.670
we wanted to share.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.610
Little did we know just how
the story would unravel.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:17.910
So for the past four years,
we've been on a crazy journey

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:21.480
pitching, shooting, editing,
and premiering at Tribeca.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:24.030
And now we hope you enjoy
this very first look

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:26.973
at Jubilee's debut documentary, Accepted.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.470
- Ladies and gentleman,
we are in the little

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.760
country town of Breaux Bridge.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.820
And we are sending over
30 percent of our kids

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.570
to the Ivy Leagues baby.

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:40.920
- [Narrator] Coming here and
seeing people get accepted

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.040
in the Stanford, Yale,
Wesley, and Princeton.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.090
It's like, dang, this is really possible.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:50.340
- [Narrator 2] And
media coming in and out.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:54.240
And they want to know about
like secret sauce of TM Landry.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.530
- You have no schedule.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.990
- So whenever I first came
here, I was like, what is this?

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.320
- It's not a normal school.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:05.013
- Remember you control your own destiny.

00:01:05.013 --> 00:01:07.747
I love you. You're out of here.

00:01:07.747 --> 00:01:10.440
- [Narrator 3] He does
everything to get us to college.

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:13.080
- [Narrator 4] You have to
put in hours upon hours.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.027
- What the hell?

00:01:14.027 --> 00:01:15.900
(laughing)

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.050
- [Narrator 5] I have
practically a whole new family.

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:22.830
- [Narrator 6] We worked our
asses off, it's like boot camp.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:25.170
- Oh, we are not raising sheep here.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:27.360
We're raising the wolves.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:28.195
I am.

00:01:28.195 --> 00:01:29.028
- I am.

00:01:29.028 --> 00:01:29.861
- Somebody

00:01:29.861 --> 00:01:30.870
- Somebody

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:35.530
- A lot of people had an image
of the school being perfect

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:39.690
and it wasn't perfect.

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:41.103
- Stop.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:44.573
All that I care about is winning.

00:01:45.545 --> 00:01:48.148
(rain falling)

00:01:48.148 --> 00:01:50.727
(rain falling)

00:01:50.727 --> 00:01:53.293
(rain falling)

00:01:53.293 --> 00:01:55.860
(rain falling)

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:58.436
(rain falling)

00:01:58.436 --> 00:02:01.481
(rain falling)

00:02:01.481 --> 00:02:03.240
- [Interviewer] When you were at TM Landry

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:06.453
did you yourself see
any instances of abuse?

00:02:09.661 --> 00:02:10.514
- [Man] I am.

00:02:10.514 --> 00:02:11.347
- [Group] I am.

00:02:11.347 --> 00:02:12.241
- [Man] Somebody.

00:02:12.241 --> 00:02:13.074
- [Group] Somebody.

